@host = http://localhost:5000
@key = development-key
@correlationId = reference-host-demo

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Client endpoint without key returns structured 401
POST {{host}}/api/Client
Content-Type: application/json
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "requestType": "GetDataHubEntityRequest",
  "data": "{}"
}

### Client endpoint with malformed envelope returns structured 400
POST {{host}}/api/Client
Content-Type: application/json
x-functions-key: {{key}}
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "requestType": "GetDataHubEntityRequest",
  "data": "{"
}

### Client endpoint with unknown request type returns structured 400
POST {{host}}/api/Client
Content-Type: application/json
x-functions-key: {{key}}
x-correlation-id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "requestType": "NotARealRequest",
  "data": "{}"
}
